text:
dsh-super-cards README · 命令行（profile 名以你的安装为准，桌面版是 desktop）：也可以在「插件」页点 Add plugin 并粘贴包名，或用 `plugin_manager` 的 `install_bundle` 指向本仓库目录
（开发/离线安装）。装好之后重启 DSH（或重载插件行）并刷新页面。
jsonc
// render_ui 的参数
{
  "title": "本周发布",
  "content": {
    "summary": "18 次发布全部完成，2 次回滚已恢复。",
    "metrics": [
      { "label": "发布次数", "value": 18, "delta": "+3", "tone": "success" },
      { "label": "失败回滚", "value": 2, "delta": "-1", "tone": "success" }
    ],
    "actions": [{ "label": "查看日志", "prompt": "查看本周的发布日志", "tone": "primary" }]
  }
}
```

dsh-super-cards README · CLI (the profile name is the one you use; the desktop app's is desktop)：You can also click Add plugin on the Plugins page and paste the package name, or point
`plugin_manager`'s `install_bundle` at this checkout (development or offline install). Restart DSH
(or reload the plugin row) and refresh the page.jsonc
// arguments of render_ui
{
  "title": "Weekly deploys",
  "content": {
    "summary": "18 deploys completed, 2 rollbacks recovered.",
    "metrics": [
      { "label": "Deploys", "value": 18, "delta": "+3", "tone": "success" },
      { "label": "Rollbacks", "value": 2, "delta": "-1", "tone": "success" }
    ],
    "actions": [{ "label": "View logs", "prompt": "Show this week's deploy logs", "tone": "primary" }]
  }
}
```
